auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  Run **Auth / Signup** once, then **Auth / Login**. Both save the token for the other requests.
  Create, start and log requests save the new id (`activityId`, `sessionId`, `cycleId`) for the requests that need it.

  Set `password` in the Local environment's secret variables. Bruno keeps secret values out of the files.
}
